 9466.429, "timestamp": "02:37:46", "text": "啊，我明白了。是的。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9468.389, "timestamp": "02:37:48", "text": "一二三。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9469.67, "timestamp": "02:37:49", "text": "共有四個。哦，是這個。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9470.71, "timestamp": "02:37:50", "text": "呃，這個，這個，嗯，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9471.269, "timestamp": "02:37:51", "text": "是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9473.83, "timestamp": "02:37:53", "text": "我以為它是普通的4。平的，或者更確切地說，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9476.23, "timestamp": "02:37:56", "text": "這是第一個。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9476.91, "timestamp": "02:37:56", "text": "啊，我明白了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9478.07, "timestamp": "02:37:58", "text": "這是第一個。 1"}]